from helpers import spec
spec('sankai',('One small turtle-like monster with hair growing densely over its back, one head, one shell, four short clawed legs and one tail; no human infant anatomy',['c04']),('No visible magical power; it crawls beneath a house, disturbed dirt only',['c05','c07']),('Cramped dark crawlspace directly beneath a timber house',['c05']),('uncanny threatening oketsu',['c07']),'Scrabble toward the viewer from under a rough timber beam, foreclaws digging grit, hairy shell filling upper frame, head craned forward in a hostile stare.','Okayama oketsu turtle-with-hairy-back variant',['Macro camera preserves small size. No birth, mother, blood, infant or gore depicted. Turtle hair is principal impossible feature.'],surface='matted coarse hair over rough shell plates, earth-caked claws',light='single low warm light leaking through floorboard gap')
spec('seiryu-gongen',('One female East Asian dragon deity as a living long serpentine dragon, one head, two eyes, four clawed limbs; no humanoid rider or extra dragon heads',['c02','c05']),('Rain pours in dense moving sheets around the rain-invoked dragon, drops beat and splash the sea beneath her; no energy aura',['c06']),('Sea crossing toward Japan, dark water beneath dragon, no invented temple details',['c03','c04']),('reverent awe-inspiring Buddhist guardian, protective rather than evil',['c01','c03','c05']),'Descend through the rain toward the viewer with head dominating foreground, long body coiling behind, foreclaws braced against wind, rain sweeping down over the sea.','female dragon guardian manifesting over a rain-swept sea',['Conventional four-limbed East Asian dragon rendering is editorial interpretation of dragon identity; no undocumented weapons or ornaments. Rain context from ritual invocation.'],surface='wet dark blue-green scales, coarse whiskers, water droplets',light='one low gold break in heavy raincloud')
spec('shibaemon-tanuki',('One living tanuki with one raccoon-dog head, two eyes, four limbs, one furry tail; rearing on hind legs, opaque plain loose robe covering lower torso and anatomy, forepaws visible',['c01','c07']),('Transform plain tree leaves in his paws into unmarked gold pieces; show leaf on one side and solid folded gold on other, no runes, letters or luminous energy',['c10']),('Dark theatrical entrance at Naniwa with blank doorway, no signs or readable decoration',['c09','c10','c11']),('awe-inspiring uncanny shapeshifter, mischievous but not evil',['c06','c14']),'Thrust a paw full of half-leaf half-gold offerings close toward viewer, rear upright with intense direct gaze, robe flaring from motion; transformation made physically obvious.','tanuki trickster using leaf-to-gold transformation',['Paw transformation distinguishes supernatural creature from ordinary tanuki. Plain robe is modest editorial clothing. Theatre details neutral and uninscribed.'],surface='coarse dark tanuki fur, worn opaque cloth, papery leaf veins, scratched gold',light='one warm off-frame theatre lantern')
spec('taotie',('One living symmetrical disembodied animal head with two bulging raised eyes and one huge open mouth; absolutely no body neck shoulders legs wings or additional heads, no invented horns',['c02','c05','c09']),('No added magical effects; head lunges forward with jaw opening in documented devouring hunger; no victim shown',['c04','c09']),('Featureless deep darkness, no invented landscape or bronze vessel',['c05']),('menacing gluttonous monster',['c01','c04']),'Surge directly toward viewer out of deep shadow, both raised eyes clearly visible, maw opening to swallow the foreground; tight frame makes bodiless head unmistakable.','living bodiless taotie head based on Zhou bronze account',['Convert documented head-without-body motif into living creature per emblem rule. Dark void is editorial neutral background, not source place. No victim or gore.'],surface='rough organic hide, wrinkled brow, aged ivory teeth, wet mouth',light='one low bronze-amber side light')
spec('tenaga-ashinaga',('Exactly one huge humanoid giant with one head, two arms, two extraordinarily long legs; fully opaque plain rough tunic, knees and impossibly extended lower legs clearly visible',['c01','c02','c05','c08']),('Use an enormous foot to rake an offshore ship toward mountain; the foot physically throws seawater and the ship tilts; no eaten people or gore',['c08']),('Mount Chokai summit above offshore water with tiny wooden ship as scale reference',['c08']),('menacing ship-raiding giant',['c03','c08']),'Hunch from the mountain summit toward viewer while one huge extended leg reaches down into the sea, foot hooking beside a tiny wooden boat; giant face and bent other knee remain large and legible.','single long-legged mountain giant from Yuza version',['Scale is documented huge mountain-seated form. Plain opaque garment is editorial modesty. No volcanic explosion or second giant blended in.'],surface='rough weathered skin, coarse opaque tunic, slick rock, frothing sea',light='one low sun slit below storm cloud')
